From: PupJune2 <PupJune2@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:00:00 +0000
Subject: CromIKO Shield Stats

Show a card with the CromIKO mascot on the new tab page, below the
search box and its shortcuts: the number of ads and trackers that the
ad blocker blocked this week (since Monday). Tapping it opens the ad
blocker settings.

The count comes from the subresource filter: each document reports its
blocked requests when it finishes loading, and they are added up in two
profile prefs (the week and the count). Incognito tabs are not counted.

